{title: Joyful Joyful}
{artist: Laura Hackett}
{key: C}
{meta: cant_key C}

{comment: Intro}
[C]Joyful, [C/Bb]joyful, Lord [F]we adore Thee
[C/E]God of [F]glory [Gsus]Lord of [G]love
[C]Hearts [C/Bb]unfold like [F]flow'rs [Fm]before Thee
[C/E]Opening [F]to the [G]sun [C]above.

{comment: Tag}
[Am7] [F] [C/E] [G] (x2)

{comment: Verse 1}
[Am7]Joyful, [F]Joyful, [C/E]we [G]adore Thee
[Am7]God of [F]glory, [C/E]Lord of [G]love
[Am7]Hearts [F]unfold like [C/E]flow'rs [G]before Thee
[Am7]Opening [F]to the [G]sun [C]above
[G]Melt the [Am]clouds of [G/B]sin and [C]sadness
[G]Drive the [Am]dark of [D]doubt [G]away
[C]Giver [C/Bb]of [C/A]immortal [C/G#]gladness,
[G/C]Fill us with the [G]light of day!

{comment: Tag}
[Am7] [F] [C/E] [G] (x2)

{comment: Verse 2}
All Thy works with joy surround Thee
Earth and heaven reflect Thy rays
Stars and angels sing around Thee
Center of unbroken praise
Field and forest, vale and mountain
Flowery meadow, flashing sea
Singing birds and flowing fountains
Call us to rejoice in Thee

{comment: Pre-Chorus}
[Dm]We sing in [C/E]jubilation, adoration [F]to a joyful [G]King
[Dm]You are singing, You are [C/E]singing,
[F]jealous love over all your [G]children

{comment: CHORUS}
[Am]I got the joy, I got [F]the joy, I got [C/E]the joy! (x4)[G]

{comment: Verse 3 (mantener C)}
Mortals join this happy chorus
Which the morning stars began
Father love is reigning over us
Brother love binds man to man
[G]Ever [Am]singing [G/B]march we onward[C]
[G]Victors in [Am]the [D]midst of strife[G]
[C]Joyful [C/Bb]music [C/A]leads us [C/G#]sunward
[G/C]In the triumph song of [G]life

{comment: Bridge}
[Am]In Your presence oh God, there [F]is fullness of joy[C/E][G]
[Am]At Your right hand oh [F]God, there are pleasures [C/E]evermore (x2 to C hold[G])

{comment: Chorus}
